{"id":"661706","name":"皮蛋青椒焖茄子","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/661706/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"2根"},{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"6瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：茄子、皮蛋、青椒、小米椒、蒜。","img":"images/661706/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"先把茄子和皮蛋放蒸锅，蒸15分钟。","img":"images/661706/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青椒去根，蒜剁碎、小米椒切粒。","img":"images/661706/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅烧干水分，放入青椒。","img":"images/661706/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"中小火炕干。","img":"images/661706/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"茄子蒸好了取出。","img":"images/661706/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"皮蛋剥去壳、青椒和茄子撕成条。","img":"images/661706/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油，小米椒和蒜末爆香。","img":"images/661706/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入皮蛋。","img":"images/661706/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用锅铲切成小块，炒香。","img":"images/661706/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入茄子，加盐翻炒入味。","img":"images/661706/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入青椒。","img":"images/661706/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后倒入酱油上色调味，出锅前淋入一圈小磨香油即可。","img":"images/661706/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661706/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}